# Terrain and placement share one grid, so the board is what it looks like.
#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot
#   any other letter = an enemy declared by a 'spawn' line below

id: ec-07-the-rim
number: 307
name: The Rim
description: A pit runs all the way round the board, a Grappler drags you toward it and two Stalkers throw you over. The only cover on this map is your own bodies.
design: Enemy composition 7 — the whole border is the hazard, so every tile is a Stalker's tile.
retired: Its own writeup calls it unfair rather than hard, and blames D-026. It is `the-maw` inverted with more enemies.

spawn g = Grappler
spawn s = Stalker
spawn l = Lobber

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

board:
  OOOOOO.BB
  O.......B
  OH..g....
  O.......O
  O^.....^O
  O.s...s.O
  ....l..HO
  A.......O
  AA.OOOOOO
